{"study_accession":"PRJNA685430","secondary_study_accession":"SRP298038","title":"The human memory T cell compartment changes across tisses of the female reproductive tract","description":"We report transcriptomic analysis of CD4 T cells isolated from vaginal, ectocervical, and endocervical tissues from 4 individuals. Overall design: Human blood, cervial, and vaginal tissues were collected from healthy women undergoing elective surgeries. Freshly isolated tissues were enzymatically processed into single cell suspensions, and blood was collected into ACD tubes and then the PBMC layer isolated uring a Lymphoprep gradient. Cells were stained for Live/Dead, CD45, CD3, CD4, CD69, CD103 and Live, CD45+CD3+CD4+ cells were sorted into different CD69/CD103 expressiing populations.","pubmed":"33953338","geo_series":"","n_samples":8,"study_labels":[{"level":"study","event_code":"SURGERY","certainty":"confirmed","delta_days":null,"delta_bucket":"UNK","time_precision":"unknown","stage":"teacher","confidence":1.0,"evidence":"Overall design: Human blood, cervial, and vaginal tissues were collected from healthy women undergoing elective surgeries.","model_version":"teacher:mlx:mlx-community/Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct-4bit"}],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN17085065","study_accession":"PRJNA685430","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"X47_Bld444CD4plusCD103minusCD69plus","description":"X47_Bld444CD4plusCD103minusCD69plus","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM4976263","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-04-30","attributes":[["source_name","Fresh PBMC"],["patient id","Donor 444"],["tissue","Peripheral Blood"],["phenotype","CD4+CD103-CD69+"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR13256758","experiment_accession":"SRX9687599","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2500","read_count":2027187,"base_count":115044056,"first_public":"2021-04-30","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM4976263: X47_Bld444CD4plusCD